NAME
    gcloud service-health organization-impacts - represents impact to assets at
        organizational level

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud service-health organization-impacts COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Represents impact to assets at organizational level.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        Get details of an asset impact by an event under an organization.

     list
        List assets impacted by events under an organization.

NOTES
    These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud alpha service-health organization-impacts

        $ gcloud beta service-health organization-impacts

